---
const base = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/`;
---

<section class="capabilities" aria-labelledby="capabilities-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Built for the whole workflow</p>
      <h2 id="capabilities-title">Coordinate. Contain. Connect. Inspect.</h2>
      <p class="intro">One control plane. Distributed execution. A clear view of every step.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="feature-grid">
    <article class="feature workflow">
      <div class="card-label"><span>Orchestration</span><span class="tag">Multi-step</span></div>
      <div class="illustration">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 440 220" role="img" aria-labelledby="workflow-title">
          <title id="workflow-title">A workflow advances from input through an Agent, a verifier, and a Function, with a feedback loop for revisions.</title>
          <defs><marker id="workflow-arrow" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7" refY="4" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto"><path d="M1 1 7 4 1 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" /></marker></defs>
          <path class="route" d="M98 100 H128 M208 100 H238 M318 100 H348" marker-end="url(#workflow-arrow)" />
          <path class="flow" d="M98 100 H128 M208 100 H238 M318 100 H348" />
          <path class="route" d="M278 132 V159 Q278 170 267 170 H179 Q168 170 168 159 V133" marker-end="url(#workflow-arrow)" />
          <path class="flow feedback-flow" d="M278 132 V159 Q278 170 267 170 H179 Q168 170 168 159 V133" />
          {[
            { x: 18, title: 'Input', symbol: '→', kind: 'TRIGGER' },
            { x: 128, title: 'Agent', symbol: '✦', kind: 'REASON' },
            { x: 238, title: 'Verify', symbol: '✓', kind: 'REVIEW' },
            { x: 348, title: 'Function', symbol: '{ }', kind: 'ACT' },
          ].map((step, i) => <g>
            <rect class={`node workflow-step step-${i}`} x={step.x} y="68" width="74" height="64" rx="10" />
            <text class="step-symbol" x={step.x + 37} y="94">{step.symbol}</text>
            <text class="node-title" x={step.x + 37} y="117">{step.title}</text>
            <text class="caption" x={step.x + 37} y="53">{step.kind}</text>
          </g>)}
          <rect class="feedback-label" x="185" y="159" width="76" height="22" rx="11" />
          <text class="policy-text" x="223" y="174">Feedback</text>
          <text class="caption" x="220" y="213">DEPENDENCIES · DATA FLOW · VERIFIER LOOPS</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="card-copy">
        <h3>Compose the whole workflow.</h3>
        <p>Connect agents, functions, and API calls with explicit dependencies and data bindings. Add bounded verifier loops to review and refine the work.</p>
        <a href={`${base}docs/concepts/workflows/`}>Explore workflows <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="feature distributed">
      <div class="card-label"><span>Execution</span><span class="tag">Distributed</span></div>
      <div class="illustration">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 440 220" role="img" aria-labelledby="distributed-title">
          <title id="distributed-title">Tasks flow from one orchestrator to three worker nodes.</title>
          <defs><marker id="dispatch-arrow" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7" refY="4" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto"><path d="M1 1 7 4 1 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" /></marker></defs>
          <path class="route" d="M169 110 H211 V48 H279 M211 110 H279 M211 110 V172 H279" marker-end="url(#dispatch-arrow)" />
          <path class="flow flow-one" d="M169 110 H211 V48 H274" />
          <path class="flow flow-two" d="M169 110 H274" />
          <path class="flow flow-three" d="M169 110 H211 V172 H274" />
          <rect class="node control" x="35" y="73" width="134" height="74" rx="12" />
          <g class="orchestrator-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="88" y="88" width="28" height="18" rx="4" /><path d="M102 106v7m-12 0h24" /></g>
          <text class="node-title" x="102" y="133">Orchestrator</text>
          {[48, 110, 172].map((y, i) => <g>
            <rect class="node" x="280" y={y - 22} width="126" height="44" rx="9" />
            <circle class={`worker-light light-${i}`} cx="298" cy={y} r="4" />
            <text class="worker-title" x="344" y={y + 4}>Worker 0{i + 1}</text>
          </g>)}
          <text class="caption" x="102" y="176">QUEUE &amp; DISPATCH</text>
          <text class="caption" x="344" y="213">CLAIM &amp; EXECUTE</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="card-copy">
        <h3>Distribute the work.</h3>
        <p>One orchestrator coordinates the workflow. Independent workers claim queued tasks and execute agents, functions, and API calls.</p>
        <a href={`${base}docs/operations/scaling/`}>Explore worker scaling <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="feature sandbox">
      <div class="card-label"><span>Boundaries</span><span class="tag">Controlled</span></div>
      <div class="illustration">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 440 220" role="img" aria-labelledby="sandbox-title">
          <title id="sandbox-title">A worker executes inside a sandbox with restrictions on filesystem and network access.</title>
          <rect class="boundary" x="108" y="25" width="224" height="166" rx="18" />
          <text class="caption" x="220" y="47">SANDBOX BOUNDARY</text>
          <path class="route" d="M75 110 H154 M286 110 H366" />
          <path class="flow" d="M121 110 H154 M286 110 H319" />
          <rect class="node" x="154" y="74" width="132" height="72" rx="12" />
          <path d="m208 92-8 7 8 7m24-14 8 7-8 7m-7-16-10 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <text class="node-title" x="220" y="130">Task worker</text>
          <g class="policy-gate"><circle class="node" cx="109" cy="110" r="12" /><path d="m104 110 3 3 6-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" /></g>
          <g class="policy-gate"><circle class="node" cx="331" cy="110" r="12" /><path d="m326 110 3 3 6-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" /></g>
          <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M35 99v-7h13l5 5h15v26H35Z" /><circle cx="386" cy="108" r="15" /><ellipse cx="386" cy="108" rx="6" ry="15" /><path d="M371 108h30" /></g>
          <text class="caption" x="51" y="145">FILES</text>
          <text class="caption" x="386" y="145">NETWORK</text>
          <rect class="policy-pill" x="148" y="159" width="144" height="22" rx="11" />
          <text class="policy-text" x="220" y="174">Access policy</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="card-copy">
        <h3>Execute inside a sandbox.</h3>
        <p>Keep task execution inside a sandbox. Scope filesystem access and control which network destinations workers can reach.</p>
        <a href={`${base}docs/operations/production-deployment/`}>Explore execution controls <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="feature api">
      <div class="card-label"><span>Integration</span><span class="tag">API driven</span></div>
      <div class="illustration">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 440 220" role="img" aria-labelledby="api-title">
          <title id="api-title">External tools connect to the RelayFold API to start, pause, resume, and inspect workflows.</title>
          <path class="route" d="M122 58 H154 Q166 58 166 70 V98 H188 M122 110 H188 M122 162 H154 Q166 162 166 150 V122 H188 M306 110 H352" />
          <path class="flow" d="M122 58 H154 Q166 58 166 70 V98 H188 M122 110 H188 M122 162 H154 Q166 162 166 150 V122 H188" />
          {['Your app', 'CLI / CI', 'Tools'].map((name, i) => <g>
            <rect class="node" x="30" y={38 + i * 52} width="92" height="40" rx="8" />
            <text class="node-title" x="76" y={62 + i * 52}>{name}</text>
          </g>)}
          <rect class="node control" x="188" y="70" width="118" height="80" rx="12" />
          <text class="api-symbol" x="247" y="105">{'{ / }'}</text>
          <text class="node-title" x="247" y="131">RelayFold API</text>
          <g class="workflow-node" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect class="node" x="352" y="76" width="58" height="68" rx="9" /><rect x="372" y="87" width="18" height="10" rx="3" /><path d="M381 97v9m-10 0h20m-20 0v9m20-9v9" /><rect x="364" y="115" width="14" height="10" rx="3" /><rect x="384" y="115" width="14" height="10" rx="3" /></g>
          <text class="caption" x="247" y="190">START · PAUSE · RESUME · INSPECT</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="card-copy">
        <h3>Connect to your toolchain.</h3>
        <p>Register workflows, start runs, pause, resume, and inspect results through a rich HTTP API. Bring orchestration into the tools you already use.</p>
        <a href={`${base}docs/api-reference/`}>Explore the API <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="feature audit">
      <div class="card-label"><span>Visibility</span><span class="tag">Auditable</span></div>
      <div class="illustration">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 440 220" role="img" aria-labelledby="audit-title">
          <title id="audit-title">A workflow event timeline alongside detailed tool call logs with arguments and completion status.</title>
          <path class="route" d="M54 57 V164" />
          {['Queued', 'Running', 'Completed'].map((state, i) => <g class={`event event-${i}`}>
            <circle class="event-dot" cx="54" cy={57 + i * 53} r="6" />
            <text class="state-label" x="71" y={61 + i * 53}>{state}</text>
          </g>)}
          <rect class="node" x="183" y="30" width="230" height="160" rx="10" />
          <path class="divider" d="M183 63 H413" />
          <circle cx="199" cy="47" r="3" fill="currentColor" /><text class="log-heading" x="212" y="51">tool_calls.log</text>
          <g class="log-row event-0"><text class="log-key" x="198" y="85">→ http_request</text><text class="log-detail" x="211" y="104">args: method, url</text></g>
          <g class="log-row event-1"><text class="log-key" x="198" y="128">← tool finished</text><text class="log-detail" x="211" y="147">isError: false</text></g>
          <rect class="log-cursor" x="198" y="164" width="7" height="10" rx="1" />
          <text class="caption" x="220" y="213">STATE HISTORY + TOOL ACTIVITY</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="card-copy">
        <h3>Follow every state change.</h3>
        <p>Trace workflow state changes through persisted events. Inspect worker logs for tool names, call arguments, and completion status.</p>
        <a href={`${base}docs/concepts/workflow-lifecycle/`}>Explore workflow history <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="feature harness">
      <div class="card-label"><span>Agent runtime</span><span class="tag">Powered by Pi</span></div>
      <div class="illustration">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 440 220" role="img" aria-labelledby="harness-title">
          <title id="harness-title">The Pi agent harness connects model reasoning and approved tools within a task session, using selected skills to produce structured output.</title>
          <rect class="boundary" x="109" y="21" width="222" height="171" rx="18" />
          <text class="caption" x="220" y="42">PI AGENT HARNESS</text>
          <path class="route" d="M89 110 H126 M314 110 H351" />
          <path class="flow" d="M89 110 H126 M314 110 H351" />
          <rect class="node" x="18" y="90" width="71" height="40" rx="8" />
          <text class="node-title" x="53" y="114">Task</text>
          <rect class="node" x="351" y="90" width="71" height="40" rx="8" />
          <text class="node-title" x="386" y="114">Output</text>
          <rect class="node" x="126" y="77" width="78" height="62" rx="10" />
          <text class="step-symbol" x="165" y="101">✦</text>
          <text class="node-title" x="165" y="125">Model</text>
          <rect class="node" x="236" y="77" width="78" height="62" rx="10" />
          <text class="step-symbol" x="275" y="101">{'{ }'}</text>
          <text class="node-title" x="275" y="125">Tools</text>
          <path class="route" d="M188 77 V64 H251 V77 M251 139 V151 H188 V139" />
          <path class="flow harness-loop" d="M188 77 V64 H251 V77 M251 139 V151 H188 V139" />
          <text class="caption" x="220" y="58">REASON → CALL</text>
          <rect class="policy-pill" x="135" y="163" width="80" height="20" rx="10" />
          <text class="policy-text" x="175" y="177">Session</text>
          <rect class="policy-pill" x="225" y="163" width="80" height="20" rx="10" />
          <text class="policy-text" x="265" y="177">Skills</text>
          <text class="caption" x="220" y="213">MODEL CHOICE · TOOL USE · TASK CONTEXT</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="card-copy">
        <h3>Put Pi to work in your agents.</h3>
        <p>LLM-provider agnostic Agent tasks, powered by Pi’s harness for sessions, tools, and skills. Choose a model for each task; RelayFold connects workflow inputs, approved capabilities, and structured outputs.</p>
        <a href={`${base}docs/concepts/tasks/agents/`}>Explore Agent tasks <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .capabilities { padding-top: 40px; }
  .section-heading { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--green); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h2 { margin: 0; max-width: 770px; font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 40px); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
  .intro { margin: 14px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 17px; }
  a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--blue); outline-offset: 4px; }
  .feature-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 22px; margin-top: 28px; }
  .feature { --tone: #256da8; --wash: #f0f6fc; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; background: var(--panel); overflow: hidden; }
  .sandbox { --tone: #14735f; --wash: #edf7f3; }
  .api { --tone: #7860a9; --wash: #f5f2fb; }
  .audit { --tone: #b66532; --wash: #fcf5ed; }
  .workflow { --tone: #32778a; --wash: #eef7f9; }
  .harness { --tone: #a94f66; --wash: #fbf0f4; }
  .card-label { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 20px 24px 0; color: var(--muted); font: 11px ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .tag { padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 5px; color: var(--tone); background: var(--wash); }
  .illustration { margin: 16px 16px 0; border-radius: 10px; color: var(--tone); background-color: var(--wash); background-image: radial-gradient(color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone) 12%, transparent) .7px, transparent .7px); background-size: 16px 16px; }
  svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  svg text { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; }
  .node { fill: #fff; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .control { stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .route { fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.4; opacity: .35; }
  .flow { fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 2.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-dasharray: 6 22; animation: dispatch 3s linear infinite; }
  .flow-two { animation-delay: -1s; }
  .flow-three { animation-delay: -2s; }
  .node-title, .worker-title { fill: var(--ink); font-size: 11px; text-anchor: middle; }
  .caption { fill: currentColor; font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-anchor: middle; }
  .worker-light { fill: currentColor; animation: pulse 3s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .light-1 { animation-delay: 1s; }
  .light-2 { animation-delay: 2s; }
  .boundary { fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.3; stroke-dasharray: 5 5; }
  .policy-gate { animation: pulse 3s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .policy-pill { fill: currentColor; opacity: .09; }
  .policy-text { fill: currentColor; font-size: 9px; text-anchor: middle; }
  .api-symbol { fill: currentColor; font-size: 24px; text-anchor: middle; }
  .event, .log-row { animation: reveal 6s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .event-1 { animation-delay: 1s; }
  .event-2 { animation-delay: 2s; }
  .event-dot, .log-cursor { fill: currentColor; }
  .state-label { fill: var(--ink); font-size: 10px; }
  .divider { stroke: currentColor; opacity: .2; }
  .log-heading { fill: var(--ink); font-size: 10px; }
  .log-key { fill: currentColor; font-size: 10px; }
  .log-detail { fill: var(--muted); font-size: 9px; }
  .log-cursor { animation: pulse 1.6s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .step-symbol { fill: currentColor; font-size: 19px; text-anchor: middle; }
  .workflow-step { animation: active-step 8s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .step-1 { animation-delay: 2s; }
  .step-2 { animation-delay: 4s; }
  .step-3 { animation-delay: 6s; }
  .feedback-flow { animation-duration: 5s; }
  .feedback-label { fill: var(--wash); }
  .harness-loop { animation-duration: 2s; }
  .card-copy { padding: 24px; }
  h3 { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
  .card-copy p { margin: 12px 0 20px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .card-copy a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: var(--tone); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
  .card-copy a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  @keyframes dispatch { to { stroke-dashoffset: -56; } }
  @keyframes pulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: .45; } 50% { opacity: 1; } }
  @keyframes reveal { 0%, 15%, 100% { opacity: .4; } 30%, 80% { opacity: 1; } }
  @keyframes active-step { 0%, 25%, 100% { fill: #fff; } 8%, 18% { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone) 18%, white); } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .capabilities * { animation: none !important; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .capabilities { padding-top: 48px; }
    .section-heading { align-items: start; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
    .feature-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 18px; }
    .card-label { padding-inline: 20px; }
    .card-copy { padding: 20px; }
  }
</style>
